~ start
Rot: So, that's what you’ve been keeping inside, huh. That’s a lot, Andy.
Andrew: Mary… if it wasn’t for me…
Rot: She’d still be alive, uh huh.
Andrew: It’s… it’s all…
Rot: All your fault. Yup.
Andrew: And everyone… h-
Rot: Hates you. Yes. Oh they act like they care, that it wasn’t your fault, but you know deep down, they blame you. But it’s okay Andy, you still have me. I’ll always be here, I will never leave you.
	#Andrew exhales
Rot: See? Doesn’t that feel better now? There’s nothing wrong with giving in, giving up… Just let it wash over you. Let the despair drown you.
Andrew: No.. she wouldn’t want me to.
	#The Rot sighs, frustrated that Andrew is not letting go.
Rot: And we were getting so close… but fine, have it your way.
=> END